ass=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/25px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/38px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/50px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bernard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png/25px-Portrait_Bernard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/03/Portrait_Bernard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bernard\" title=\"Bernard\">Bernard</a> who then gives <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Light\" title=\"Guiding Light\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Ring_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Guiding_Light\" title=\"Guiding Light\">Guiding Light</a> to the player character to access the tower's basement.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This threadbare book looks like it once contained a play, but most of it has been lost to time, vermin, and an unfortunate ink spill. Only two full sentences are distinguishable.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>How can I trust? How will I ever know?\n</p><p>How can I show myself, my darkest me?\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195324\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.058 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1964/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28128/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7197/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.016/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 977176/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   49.115      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   49.115      1 -total\n 42.79%   21.016      7 Template:Icon_text\n 39.46%   19.378     23 Template:Trim\n 19.23%    9.447      2 Template:Uid\n 15.33%    7.528      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 12.90%    6.338      1 Template:Main_only\n 11.75%    5.773      1 Template:Item_icon\n 11.20%    5.502      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.89%    5.349      2 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12800-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195324 and revision id 359831. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}